<title>BELGIUM: Belgian 1995 trade surplus revised down slightly.</title>
<headline>Belgian 1995 trade surplus revised down slightly.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium's 1995 trade surplus has been revised down slightly to 426.9 billion Belgian francs from 431.8 billion francs, the Belgian National Bank said on Friday.</p>
<p>Exports amounted to 4,988.9 billion francs, revised from 4,956.1 billion. Imports totalled 4,562.0 billion francs, revised from 4,524.3 billion, the central bank said in its weekly economic indicators.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
